spec PushAdminRead.tla
check INVARIANTS TypeOK CookieRequiresMatchingPost QueryRequiresRootGet QueryRequiresMatchingCookie QueryRequiresValidInput RowsStayWithRequest
reach OwnerRendered | one configured
reach EmptyQuery | one configured
reach FailedQuery | one configured
reach CodeAccepted | one configured
reach WrongCodeDenied | one configured
reach FailedCodeCheckDenied | one configured
reach FailedCookieCheckDenied | one configured
reach BadFormBlocked | one configured
reach MissingCookieShowsForm | one configured
reach ClaimWithoutCookieShowsForm | one configured
reach BadInputBlocked | one configured
reach WrongPathBlocked | one configured
reach WrongMethodBlocked | one configured
reach MissingDigestBlocksCode | blank digest
reach MissingDigestBlocksCookie | blank digest
reach OverlappingRequests | two concurrent
run one configured server | Count=1 Configured=TRUE
run blank digest config | Count=1 Configured=FALSE
run two concurrent requests | Count=2 Configured=TRUE
